  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wastewater treatment system for Municipality of Leskovac (Implementation Phase)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is defined as the design construction and subsequent operation of a wastewater treatment system for the town of Leskovac in Serbia. Main components of the project are:- Construction of the Waste Water Treatment plant with capacity of 100,000 people;- Sewage collection system with 3,567 additional new connections for 11,300 people (ORIO component);- Connection of industrial facilities to WWTP;- Training and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
